@host = http://localhost:8080
@password = ChangeUserPassword_2026

### 建立会话并获取 CSRF
GET {{host}}/api/auth/session

> {% client.global.set("csrf", response.body.csrf); %}

### 登录（改成自己的首次初始化密码）
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"account":"19900000001","password":"{{password}}","role":"USER"}

> {% client.global.set("csrf", response.body.csrf); %}

### 动态组合查询；价格为分，范围包含边界
GET {{host}}/api/products?scope=market&q=机械&category=数码配件&minPrice=10000&maxPrice=20000

### 单独上限，无关键词和分类
GET {{host}}/api/products?maxPrice=5000

### JOIN 商品与卖家
GET {{host}}/api/queries/products/101

### JOIN 当前用户收藏
GET {{host}}/api/queries/favorites

### JOIN 当前用户购买记录
GET {{host}}/api/queries/purchases

### 批量删除：先新建自己的无历史草稿，再将示例编号替换为实际编号
POST {{host}}/api/products/batch-delete
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"ids":[999998,999999]}
